    "PCB outline/Z/thickness, ESP32-S3 module shield/antenna, PY260 optical barrel/glass/sensor/FPC, microSD package/contact envelopes, microphone and LED coupling are inferred from exact-product photos and native apertures; no PCB/production fit claim.",
    "Exact U174-B photos and dimension drawing show two 1×3 headers and rear G44/G43/5V plus EN/G0/GND labels. Shared schematic/MCP summary says Header4/GPIO3/GPIO8; discrepancy submitted to official feedback. Geometry follows exact-product photos/drawing.",
